---
import Section from "../site/Section.astro"
import Split from "../site/Split.astro"
import Stage from "../site/Stage.astro"
import Bylines from "../product/Bylines.astro"
---

<Section>
  <Split rev>
    <div slot="start" data-in-view="rise">
      <Stage><Bylines /></Stage>
    </div>
    <div slot="end" class="copy">
      <h2 class="h2">Every write has an author.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        Each version, block and activity entry names who made it. The built-in agent shows as Observe Agent for admin, a connected
        agent as admin (via Claude Code), and a service account under its own name.
      </p>
      <p class="lead">
        The client name is chosen by the client, so it is a label: it never changes what the client may do.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Split>
</Section>

<style>
  .copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .copy .lead {
    font-size: 17px;
  }
</style>
